{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo versio</strong>n of <strong>Of Ash and Steel</strong> invites you to experience the very beginning of Tristan\u2019s journey. Step onto the perilous lands of Grayshaft and face the bandits and monsters that plague the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend several hours freely exploring the game\u2019s starting region, following the main story while tackling numerous side quests. Experiment with skill trees and professions, explore the surroundings of the lumberjack camp and lend them a hand in their hard labour. Team up with Fox to investigate an abandoned village, and try to find your way to the harbour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo also features the <strong>Arena Master Mode</strong>, where the most seasoned players can put their skills and the combat system of <strong>Of Ash and Steel</strong> to the test. This mode features fast-paced battles in the arena, where you can earn experience, gold, and fame. Upgrade your weapons and armour, master new techniques, and prove yourself worthy to be called the greatest gladiator on Grayshaft!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/db264aabb221376bb11ec3e08aa67a2e.avif?t=1760541617\" width=616 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Of Ash and Steel</strong> is an immersive third-person open-world RPG created by a passionate team that values the essence of classic old-school RPGs and modern designs. Explore the lands of a once-prosperous island, hone your combat skills, and survive in the unforgiving realm of the Kingdom of the Seven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/77201c384669e6b2e45a4f21b975d276.avif?t=1760541617\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to stand up for yourself using different combat stances, environments, and active skills. Tailor your fighting style to suit you, from the agile rapier wielder to a heavy armour-clad knight, or create something unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/4965f6e65bf3f3c8c6b0f730ee87e238.poster.avif?t=1760541617\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/4965f6e65bf3f3c8c6b0f730ee87e238.webm?t=1760541617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/6df5659c3852a86d69036800aa61699f.avif?t=1760541617\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain strength, survive, and forge alliances. Prove that even someone who has lost everything can become a significant force that can shape the fate of the whole island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/a4bf5751883f962913cce9229b8c8c9a.poster.avif?t=1760541617\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/a4bf5751883f962913cce9229b8c8c9a.webm?t=1760541617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/f9a100c7567d4e9dd60b274c9c0d092f.avif?t=1760541617\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of Ash and Steel has no marker system, and quests won't lead you by the hand. Rediscover the joy of exploration and let curiosity be your guide; the world promises rich rewards for those who dare to uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/6ba15af355d4e594240d6c6d4039aee9.poster.avif?t=1760541617\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/6ba15af355d4e594240d6c6d4039aee9.webm?t=1760541617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708420?t=1760541617","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/28bcc2bee9de772d2a1aa2ab7b3affbabb442277/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760541617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/95d9e758397fd5557b255ecc667e59b529919706/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760541617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/95d9e758397fd5557b255ecc667e59b529919706/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760541617","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo versio</strong>n of <strong>Of Ash and Steel</strong> invites you to experience the very beginning of Tristan\u2019s journey. Step onto the perilous lands of Grayshaft and face the bandits and monsters that plague the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend several hours freely exploring the game\u2019s starting region, following the main story while tackling numerous side quests. Experiment with skill trees and professions, explore the surroundings of the lumberjack camp and lend them a hand in their hard labour. Team up with Fox to investigate an abandoned village, and try to find your way to the harbour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo also features the <strong>Arena Master Mode</strong>, where the most seasoned players can put their skills and the combat system of <strong>Of Ash and Steel</strong> to the test. This mode features fast-paced battles in the arena, where you can earn experience, gold, and fame. Upgrade your weapons and armour, master new techniques, and prove yourself worthy to be called the greatest gladiator on Grayshaft!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/db264aabb221376bb11ec3e08aa67a2e.avif?t=1760541617\" width=616 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Of Ash and Steel</strong> is an immersive third-person open-world RPG created by a passionate team that values the essence of classic old-school RPGs and modern designs. Explore the lands of a once-prosperous island, hone your combat skills, and survive in the unforgiving realm of the Kingdom of the Seven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/77201c384669e6b2e45a4f21b975d276.avif?t=1760541617\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to stand up for yourself using different combat stances, environments, and active skills. Tailor your fighting style to suit you, from the agile rapier wielder to a heavy armour-clad knight, or create something unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/4965f6e65bf3f3c8c6b0f730ee87e238.poster.avif?t=1760541617\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/4965f6e65bf3f3c8c6b0f730ee87e238.webm?t=1760541617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/6df5659c3852a86d69036800aa61699f.avif?t=1760541617\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain strength, survive, and forge alliances. Prove that even someone who has lost everything can become a significant force that can shape the fate of the whole island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/a4bf5751883f962913cce9229b8c8c9a.poster.avif?t=1760541617\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/a4bf5751883f962913cce9229b8c8c9a.webm?t=1760541617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/f9a100c7567d4e9dd60b274c9c0d092f.avif?t=1760541617\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of Ash and Steel has no marker system, and quests won't lead you by the hand. Rediscover the joy of exploration and let curiosity be your guide; the world promises rich rewards for those who dare to uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/6ba15af355d4e594240d6c6d4039aee9.poster.avif?t=1760541617\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/extras/6ba15af355d4e594240d6c6d4039aee9.webm?t=1760541617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Fire & Frost"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2893820","name":"Of Ash and Steel"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708420/cfa077ad8f331fd8ba6177287ac89759a84baac8/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760541617","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708420/807421859/899269dc60b7d7fff1306992f168cdb21ae9c406/1760351950/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760377467","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708420/807421859/899269dc60b7d7fff1306992f168cdb21ae9c406/1760351950/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760377467","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708420/807421859/899269dc60b7d7fff1306992f168cdb21ae9c406/1760351950/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760377467","id":257216885,"mp4":{"480":"h